2. The drawings: all rights reserved
------------------------------------

The Poppy character and every drawing and picture in this repository are
Copyright (c) 2026 Michel Neufeglise. All rights reserved.

This covers:
  - docs/design/       (the emotion sheets, the chat-window picture and sketches)
  - docs/screenshots/  (screenshots, which show the drawings)
  - assets/states/     (Poppy's poses, cut from the emotion sheet)
  - assets/chat/       (the chat window pieces, cut from the chat-window picture)
  - assets/tray/       (the menu-bar icon, made from a drawing)
  - assets/female/     (female Poppy: her poses, names, header and menu-bar icon)

You may download and run Poppy with these drawings for your own personal use.
You may not reuse, redistribute, modify or sell the drawings or the Poppy
character on their own or in other projects without written permission.
If you fork this project to make something new, please draw your own character.

